  "description": "A new secondary access gate is proposed adjacent to the Community Room at Margery Street Community Hall to help address ongoing anti-social and drug-related activity in the area, specifically on the alleyway that connects Margery Street to the rear communal area. The gate will be designed to match the style, materials, and finish of the existing boundary fencing, ensuring a consistent appearance. The gate will form part of the Margery Street elevation to the recently completed scheme.",
